1
00:00:58,799 --> 00:01:01,359
Uncle Mingli spent 200,000 to buy a son-in-law.

2
00:01:01,359 --> 00:01:02,560
Serves him right to suffer.

3
00:01:03,119 --> 00:01:04,120
If he didn't suffer,

4
00:01:04,319 --> 00:01:06,560
wouldn't Uncle Mingli's 200,000 be wasted?

5
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,120
How many times has it been?

6
00:01:08,159 --> 00:01:09,920
Last time, he drove his wife away

7
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:11,560
and knelt under the big tree all day.

8
00:01:12,719 --> 00:01:13,879
Hard to say.

9
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:16,920
You hear of people buying a wife,

10
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:18,760
not buying a son-in-law.

11
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,280
Hard to say.

12
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,920
Since they bought him,

13
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:23,959
you have to listen

14
00:01:23,959 --> 00:01:24,959
to whatever they say,

15
00:01:24,959 --> 00:01:26,840
and do what they want, right?

16
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:29,959
Bro, this Mingli

17
00:01:29,959 --> 00:01:31,359
is one ruthless guy.

18
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:35,799
His... His daughter is pretty,

19
00:01:36,319 --> 00:01:37,719
but she couldn't find a husband.

20
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:43,920
Li Ermiao.

21
00:01:45,959 --> 00:01:46,879
Li Ermiao.

22
00:01:50,159 --> 00:01:51,400
I'm a lawyer.

23
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,480
My name is Fu Ting.

24
00:01:53,159 --> 00:01:54,400
How I got here,

25
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,680
I still haven't figured out.

26
00:01:56,359 --> 00:01:59,000
Don't overthink it now. Bear with it.

27
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:01,000
I can help you out.

28
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:02,480
You must endure it.

29
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,359
Endure?

30
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:10,520
I've endured it for five years!

31
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:13,039
Who has ever helped me?

32
00:02:14,879 --> 00:02:16,479
This is just my fate.

33
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,159
How can he see me?

34
00:02:48,919 --> 00:02:50,000
Stop, stop, stop!

35
00:02:50,199 --> 00:02:51,400
That kowtow wasn't loud enough. Come on!

36
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:54,639
Kowtow properly!

37
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:55,960
In front of the ancestors,

38
00:02:56,159 --> 00:02:57,560
kowtow once and call them Mom and Dad!

39
00:02:58,439 --> 00:02:59,560
Come on! Kowtow! Kowtow!

40
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,199
Kowtow!

41
00:03:00,479 --> 00:03:01,280
Kowtow!

42
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,199
Go on, kowtow!

43
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:04,400
Dad.

44
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,039
Mom.

45
00:03:07,639 --> 00:03:08,639
Not good enough!

46
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:10,280
It wasn't loud enough! Come on, come on!

47
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,599
That's more like it!

48
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:14,960
Keep kowtowing!

49
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:17,000
Rule for marrying into the wife's family:

50
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,240
You must do nine full kowtows!

51
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,400
If it's not loud, it doesn't count!

52
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:20,919
Kowtow! Kowtow! Kowtow!

53
00:03:20,919 --> 00:03:21,560
Dad.

54
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,159
Mom.

55
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:24,759
One!

56
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:25,759
Good!

57
00:03:26,719 --> 00:03:27,360
Dad.

58
00:03:28,159 --> 00:03:28,680
Mom.

59
00:03:29,199 --> 00:03:30,000
Two!

60
00:03:30,039 --> 00:03:30,840
Good!

61
00:03:31,759 --> 00:03:32,560
Dad.

62
00:03:33,439 --> 00:03:34,240
Mom.

63
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,159
Three!

64
00:03:36,599 --> 00:03:37,400
Dad.

65
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,080
Mom.

66
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:40,080
Four!

67
00:03:41,199 --> 00:03:42,000
Dad.

68
00:03:42,439 --> 00:03:43,240
Mom.

69
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,560
Five! That's five!

70
00:03:44,879 --> 00:03:45,680
Dad.

71
00:03:46,439 --> 00:03:47,240
Mom.

72
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,599
Six! That's six!

73
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:49,639
Dad.

74
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:51,199
Mom.

75
00:03:51,439 --> 00:03:52,639
Seven! That's seven!

76
00:03:52,719 --> 00:03:53,520
Dad.

77
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:54,879
Mom.

78
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,360
Eight! That's eight!

79
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:57,879
Dad.

80
00:03:58,479 --> 00:03:59,199
Mom.

81
00:03:59,199 --> 00:04:00,680
Nine!

82
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,960
Good!

83
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:02,759
That's enough, that's enough.

84
00:04:02,879 --> 00:04:05,080
I'd say this kid is sincere enough.

85
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,240
If he injures himself,

86
00:04:06,599 --> 00:04:08,759
how can he carry on the family line?

87
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,360
All right, all right, get up.

88
00:04:11,159 --> 00:04:12,360
Everyone, go back and get some rest.

89
00:04:12,479 --> 00:04:13,479
It's getting late.

90
00:04:13,479 --> 00:04:14,840
There's nothing more to see here.

91
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:15,680
All right.

92
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,480
Time to go back to bed.

93
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,360
Head back to sleep.

94
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,279
Let's go.

95
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,759
Here comes the Village Chief.

96
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:32,800
The Village Chief is here.

97
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:33,160
Village Chief.

98
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:33,879
Come, have a seat.

99
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,480
I stepped down years ago.

100
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,839
Don't call me Village Chief anymore.

101
00:04:38,199 --> 00:04:39,560
Once a village chief,

102
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,759
always a village chief.

103
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:42,199
That rule can't be broken.

104
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:43,120
Right, exactly.

105
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:46,079
What happened today?

106
00:04:46,639 --> 00:04:48,040
You have no idea, Village Chief.

107
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:49,360
Out of the kindness of my heart,

108
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:51,199
I signed his kid up for Rural Medical Insurance.

109
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:53,079
I just wrote one character wrong.

110
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,680
I got one character wrong in Situ Guangyi.

111
00:04:55,839 --> 00:04:56,959
When I brought it home and showed him,

112
00:04:56,959 --> 00:04:57,959
he got upset.

113
00:04:58,120 --> 00:05:00,279
He blamed me for messing up the kid's name.

114
00:05:00,959 --> 00:05:01,639
Because of this,

115
00:05:01,639 --> 00:05:02,720
my mom scolded him a bit

116
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,639
and gave him a smack.

117
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,600
And he lost his temper!

118
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,160
He shoved my mom right to the ground!

119
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:08,120
My mom's still groaning in bed.

120
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:09,959
When my dad went to confront him,

121
00:05:09,959 --> 00:05:10,839
he jumped right into the river!

122
00:05:10,839 --> 00:05:11,720
What was he trying to do?

123
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:14,240
He made my dad fall and hurt his leg!

124
00:05:17,759 --> 00:05:19,560
Mingli, how's that leg of yours?

125
00:05:20,319 --> 00:05:21,560
The leg isn't that bad.

126
00:05:22,199 --> 00:05:23,800
It's all that bastard's fault,

127
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,839
making me take a fall!

128
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:26,759
The bone's fine, though.

129
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:30,240
I think the top priority now

130
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:32,439
is for you to take your parents

131
00:05:32,439 --> 00:05:33,839
to the hospital for a checkup,

132
00:05:34,279 --> 00:05:36,000
to see if there's any real problem.

133
00:05:36,199 --> 00:05:36,879
Right, exactly.

134
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:47,600
That useless bum dared to push me!

135
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:49,079
Drag him to the ancestral hall!

136
00:05:49,199 --> 00:05:50,360
Call the elders!

137
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:51,040
Alright.

138
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,920
Brother, let's go.

139
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,680
That animal!

140
00:06:03,839 --> 00:06:04,839
What happened here?

141
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,480
Brother, Sister-in-law...

142
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,279
How did it get like this?

143
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,480
How did this happen?

144
00:06:09,639 --> 00:06:10,800
Ask him yourself!

145
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,199
Look what he did to my mom!

146
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:14,279
Li Ermiao thinks he's tough now!

147
00:06:14,279 --> 00:06:15,680
Now he dares to hit back!

148
00:06:15,759 --> 00:06:16,560
Ermiao...

149
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:18,079
How could you hit an elder?

150
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,279
He's crazy!

151
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:23,720
Just look at her! Look at her!

152
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:24,959
If we hadn't protected Mom,

153
00:06:24,959 --> 00:06:26,079
he would've sent her to the grave!

154
00:06:26,199 --> 00:06:26,879
5,000 yuan.

155
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:27,959
You figure out how to pay it.

156
00:06:30,759 --> 00:06:31,680
Brother, Sister-in-law,

157
00:06:32,279 --> 00:06:34,160
you know our situation.

158
00:06:34,879 --> 00:06:36,680
Ermiao's parents died early.

159
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,959
I raised him with my own hands.

160
00:06:39,079 --> 00:06:41,079
My three kids went to the city,

161
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:42,040
and none of them care about me.

162
00:06:42,279 --> 00:06:43,480
All I have is that little plot of land.

163
00:06:43,839 --> 00:06:45,560
Where am I going to get 5,000 yuan?

164
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,439
Go steal it or rob someone!

165
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:48,000
5,000 yuan, not a penny less!

166
00:06:48,079 --> 00:06:49,399
Sister, you can't talk like that.

167
00:06:49,399 --> 00:06:50,160
Why can't I?

168
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:51,480
Look at what he did to my mom!

169
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,399
And you think you're in the right?

170
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,279
What is wrong with you?

171
00:06:56,279 --> 00:06:57,879
The 200,000 yuan they gave—

172
00:06:58,439 --> 00:07:00,199
where did the money for your mom's care come from?

173
00:07:00,279 --> 00:07:02,199
Uncle, stay out of this!

174
00:07:02,279 --> 00:07:02,879
And after that,

175
00:07:02,879 --> 00:07:04,600
where did the money for her funeral come from?

176
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,839
Why are you being so unreasonable?

177
00:07:06,079 --> 00:07:06,959
Apologize right now!

178
00:07:06,959 --> 00:07:07,759
Li Shun!

179
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:09,240
Stop putting on an act!

180
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:11,000
Is this about the 200,000 yuan?

181
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:13,120
This crook has hepatitis B!

182
00:07:13,199 --> 00:07:15,199
He never mentioned it when he married in!

183
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:17,879
Now my little grandson has it too!

184
00:07:17,879 --> 00:07:19,879
Tell me, isn't he a menace?

185
00:07:19,879 --> 00:07:21,079
What a piece of trash!

186
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,680
I'll kick you to death!

187
00:07:23,639 --> 00:07:24,839
Sister-in-law, Brother,

188
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,079
we really didn't know!

189
00:07:27,079 --> 00:07:28,279
In this backwater place,

190
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:29,439
he was never tested!

191
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:31,279
We didn't deceive you on purpose!

192
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,759
And now look at this!

193
00:07:34,879 --> 00:07:37,839
Our whole family supported this useless bum,

194
00:07:38,079 --> 00:07:39,480
fed him for five whole years!

195
00:07:39,759 --> 00:07:42,360
Even a dog would wag its tail at me!

196
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:44,000
Yet he dared to lay a hand on me!

197
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:46,800
This isn't over until we sort it today!

198
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:47,879
Brother, Sister-in-law...

199
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:48,519
I...

200
00:07:48,519 --> 00:07:49,480
He... he hit an elder.

201
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,360
We fed an ungrateful wretch for 5 years!

202
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,639
He... he was wrong to hit an elder.

203
00:07:51,639 --> 00:07:53,839
Let me apologize for him, okay?

204
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:02,480
Sister-in-law, whatever you say,

205
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,480
we'll do.

206
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,480
5,000 yuan for medical bills.

207
00:08:05,639 --> 00:08:07,000
Not a single penny less.

208
00:08:07,959 --> 00:08:09,560
Doesn't he like hitting people?

209
00:08:09,759 --> 00:08:11,040
Couldn't keep his hands to himself?

210
00:08:11,199 --> 00:08:13,480
Make him slap his own face!

211
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,040
Slap it hard!

212
00:08:15,279 --> 00:08:16,879
Until we're satisfied!

213
00:08:17,199 --> 00:08:18,079
Until I say stop,

214
00:08:18,079 --> 00:08:19,079
you don't stop!

215
00:08:19,079 --> 00:08:20,199
Slap yourself!

216
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,439
Let's see if it kills you!

217
00:08:22,439 --> 00:08:23,879
Alright, alright, we'll do it ourselves!

218
00:08:25,519 --> 00:08:26,959
He's tied up, how can he?

219
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:37,799
Well?

220
00:08:37,799 --> 00:08:38,440
Hit him!

221
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,840
Do we have to do it ourselves?

222
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:41,279
Hit him!

223
00:08:53,679 --> 00:08:54,840
Beat him hard!

224
00:08:57,399 --> 00:08:58,639
The Patriarch is here!

225
00:09:00,559 --> 00:09:01,360
Mingli.

226
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:03,200
That's enough.

227
00:09:04,279 --> 00:09:05,240
Hitting an elder...

228
00:09:05,559 --> 00:09:06,639
is definitely wrong.

229
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:07,480
It was our fault.

230
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,159
We were wrong.

231
00:09:08,159 --> 00:09:09,480
Here's how we should handle this.

232
00:09:10,279 --> 00:09:11,600
Have him write a pledge,

233
00:09:12,639 --> 00:09:14,679
promising this will never happen again.

234
00:09:14,679 --> 00:09:15,840
I'll sign it,

235
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,000
and we'll let him off.

236
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,360
What do you think?

237
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,799
Since you've spoken up, Old Village Chief,

238
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:23,720
otherwise...

239
00:09:24,799 --> 00:09:27,639
we wouldn't stop until the stars came out.

240
00:09:28,399 --> 00:09:30,200
Xiume, what do you think?

241
00:09:32,399 --> 00:09:34,279
Since the Patriarch said so,

242
00:09:35,679 --> 00:09:36,879
let's let him off.

243
00:09:37,639 --> 00:09:38,360
Husband,

244
00:09:38,639 --> 00:09:39,360
hurry up and write it!

245
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,840
Okay, okay, we'll write it!

246
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,080
Hurry up and write!

247
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:47,200
Write it now!

248
00:10:04,559 --> 00:10:05,279
You're full?

249
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:06,960
Done eating, son?

250
00:10:09,879 --> 00:10:11,000
Give Azun a bite.

251
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:11,799
Go ahead and feed him.

252
00:10:11,799 --> 00:10:12,279
Azun.

253
00:10:12,919 --> 00:10:13,399
Azun.

254
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,600
Give our boy a piece of meat too.

255
00:10:18,399 --> 00:10:20,600
Can such a young child eat meat?

256
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:21,519
What if he chokes?

257
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,679
Azun, Azun.

258
00:10:23,679 --> 00:10:24,879
Look at my grandson.

259
00:10:24,879 --> 00:10:25,879
So chubby and fair.

260
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,600
Give him a piece.

261
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,120
Nonsense, he's full.

262
00:10:33,679 --> 00:10:34,480
Just one more piece.

263
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,679
All right, give it to him.

264
00:10:40,759 --> 00:10:41,840
Azun.

265
00:10:45,639 --> 00:10:46,759
Careful with your little hands.

266
00:10:47,639 --> 00:10:49,000
Let's wait a bit, okay?

267
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,480
Daddy will take you out to play, okay?

268
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:51,440
Okay!

269
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,480
No.

270
00:10:52,559 --> 00:10:53,480
Mommy will take you.

271
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:55,000
Wash the dishes.

272
00:10:55,279 --> 00:10:55,799
Okay.

273
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:13,279
Find me! Come find me, quick! Come on!

274
00:11:15,759 --> 00:11:16,120
Come on.

275
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:16,559
Mom.

276
00:11:21,559 --> 00:11:23,080
I'll draw a little heart for you.

277
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:29,600
So yummy.

278
00:11:29,919 --> 00:11:31,720
If it's yummy, Mom will bring you again, okay?

279
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,519
Okay.

280
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,120
You stink so bad.

281
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,279
Go wash yourself properly.

282
00:11:38,919 --> 00:11:40,519
Stinky Li Ermiao.

283
00:11:40,639 --> 00:11:42,519
Run all you want, you can't escape.

284
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:44,039
Xiulan.

285
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:47,840
Look, could you find me some clothes?

286
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:48,720
All your clothes are in that room.

287
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:49,919
Where am I supposed to find them?

288
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,320
Xiulan, Xiulan.

289
00:11:53,519 --> 00:11:56,320
Give me some of those leftovers you packed.

290
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,799
I haven't eaten for two days.

291
00:11:57,799 --> 00:11:59,679
I brought this back for Mom and Dad.

292
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:00,919
You're not getting shit!

293
00:12:00,919 --> 00:12:02,039
You don't get shit!

294
00:12:10,799 --> 00:12:11,399
Come here.

295
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,679
Falling in love is always easy.

296
00:12:58,399 --> 00:13:00,000
Staying together is so hard.

297
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:01,759
What are you doing?

298
00:13:03,039 --> 00:13:04,480
Xiulan, let me in.

299
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:05,399
You can't come in!

300
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:08,879
You snore, grind your teeth, and fart!

301
00:13:08,879 --> 00:13:10,360
What if you startle my baby?

302
00:13:10,559 --> 00:13:11,440
Starting today,

303
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:12,480
you're sleeping in the downstairs storage room.

304
00:14:07,679 --> 00:14:09,159
I saw everything today.

305
00:14:09,799 --> 00:14:11,639
What kind of people are they?

306
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:13,679
Completely uncouth,

307
00:14:13,679 --> 00:14:15,440
acting like ruthless local bullies.

308
00:14:15,639 --> 00:14:17,039
Over a mere 5,000 yuan,

309
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:18,879
look how they've tormented him.

310
00:14:22,279 --> 00:14:23,360
Li Ermiao, oh Li Ermiao...

311
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:25,080
Why don't you leave this place?

312
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:26,440
Go venture out.

313
00:14:26,759 --> 00:14:28,679
You could do anything in a big city.

314
00:14:29,559 --> 00:14:31,399
Washing dishes, clearing tables,

315
00:14:31,559 --> 00:14:33,080
or even working on a construction site,

316
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:35,679
doing whatever work you're capable of.

317
00:14:36,159 --> 00:14:38,279
Why stay here and take this abuse?

318
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:40,759
It's easy for you to talk from your high horse.

319
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:43,159
Who are you anyway?

320
00:14:43,159 --> 00:14:44,360
Where did you crawl out from?

321
00:14:44,759 --> 00:14:46,000
Just for 5,000 yuan?

322
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:48,240
Do you know how hard it is to make 5,000 here?

323
00:14:49,399 --> 00:14:52,440
The other day, Old Village Chief was building a house.

324
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:55,360
I worked four days and got only 120 yuan.

325
00:14:55,639 --> 00:14:57,080
I didn't even finish primary school.

326
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,080
I have no education.

327
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,639
You want me to go to a big city?

328
00:15:01,639 --> 00:15:03,039
I'd be totally in the dark.

329
00:15:03,039 --> 00:15:04,080
Who could I turn to?

330
00:15:04,679 --> 00:15:06,279
Where would I even find a job?

331
00:15:06,679 --> 00:15:08,399
Do you want me to starve to death?

332
00:15:08,759 --> 00:15:09,600
I admit,

333
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:12,080
you'll face grievances out there,

334
00:15:12,159 --> 00:15:13,240
and unfair treatment too.

335
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,960
But that hardship and injustice...

336
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:17,039
they'll be worth it.

337
00:15:17,039 --> 00:15:18,480
It's far better than taking abuse here.

338
00:15:18,679 --> 00:15:21,480
Get out there, Li Ermiao. Get out there!

339
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:32,480
Li Ermiao!

340
00:15:32,559 --> 00:15:34,120
Get the hell out here!

341
00:15:34,679 --> 00:15:36,240
Don't let me catch you!

342
00:15:38,840 --> 00:15:40,679
Fast on your feet, aren't you?

343
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:47,759
Over there!

344
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:48,559
Get him!

345
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:04,559
Li Ermiao, don't run!

346
00:16:11,159 --> 00:16:11,720
Trying to run?

347
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:16,399
Go ahead, keep running!

348
00:16:17,559 --> 00:16:18,720
Think you're tough now, huh?

349
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:20,879
Leave?

350
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:25,399
My uncle says we can let you leave.

351
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,799
Just pay back all the money

352
00:16:26,799 --> 00:16:28,039
our family spent on you over the years!

353
00:16:28,039 --> 00:16:29,679
I've slaved away for all these years!

354
00:16:30,399 --> 00:16:31,679
I don't owe your family anything!

355
00:16:31,759 --> 00:16:32,960
If I spend money to buy an ox,

356
00:16:32,960 --> 00:16:33,919
it's brought back to work!

357
00:16:34,679 --> 00:16:35,960
My uncle spent so much money

358
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:37,480
buying you to carry on the family line,

359
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:39,399
yet you're diseased and gave it to the kid!

360
00:16:39,399 --> 00:16:40,559
You're nothing but a curse!

361
00:16:40,639 --> 00:16:41,600
Stop wasting your breath on him.

362
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:42,600
Just tie him up here.

363
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:44,080
We'll deal with him tomorrow.

364
00:16:44,279 --> 00:16:46,759
Uncle, we'll head back first, then.

365
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:49,000
Go on. Worthless piece of trash!

366
00:16:49,919 --> 00:16:50,679
Go spend time with the child.

367
00:16:50,679 --> 00:16:51,480
Sure, sure.

368
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:52,639
We're heading out, Uncle.

369
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:54,279
Take care.

370
00:16:54,279 --> 00:16:55,080
Alright, Auntie.
